research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-cauchy-product-of-geometric-series.md-794-  ([[thm-dirichlet-rearrangement]]) and multiplied by another
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-cauchy-product-of-geometric-series.md:795:  ([[thm-mertens]]); a conditionally convergent one may be reordered to any sum
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-cauchy-product-of-geometric-series.md-796-  whatever ([[thm-riemann-series-theorem]]). The difference is not one of degree.
